ation,"}, {"t": "the speaker is showing a positive attitude to a person, a situation，", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.3265, "y": 0.7137, "w": 0.5524, "h": 0.0145}, {"t": "etc.， for example: the happy/golden mean 说话人对某人、某情况", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.3244, "y": 0.7296, "w": 0.5544, "h": 0.0175}, {"t": "等表示赞许，如 the happy/golden mean（中庸之道）", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.3265, "y": 0.7471, "w": 0.4476, "h": 0.016}, {"c": 1.0, "fill": true, "x": 0.5, "y": 0.7473, "w": 0.2769, "h": 0.0155, "t": "happy/golden mean (4Zi)"}, {"t": "disapproving 含贬义", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.1191, "y": 0.7645, "w": 0.1848, "h": 0.016}, {"t": "the speaker is showing a negative attitude to a person, a situation，", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.3244, "y": 0.7645, "w": 0.5626, "h": 0.016}, {"c": 1.0, "fill": true, "x": 0.5, "y": 0.765, "w": 0.389, "h": 0.0155, "t": "ng a negative attitude to a person, a situation,"}, {"t": "etc.， for example: a snake in the grass 说话人对某人、某情况等表", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.3244, "y": 0.7805, "w": 0.5606, "h": 0.0175}, {"t": "示反感，如 a snake in the grass（阴险的人）", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.3265, "y": 0.798, "w": 0.3717, "h": 0.0175}, {"c": 1.0, "fill": true, "x": 0.5, "y": 0.7983, "w": 0.1989, "h": 0.0162, "t": "in the grass (HK2#9 1)"}, {"t": "humorous 幽默", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.1191, "y": 0.8154, "w": 0.1417, "h": 0.0145}, {"c": 1.0, "fill": true, "x": 0.5, "y": 0.8168, "w": 0.3176, "h": 0.0147, "t": "to be funny, not serious, for example:"}, {"t": "the speaker intends to be funny, not serious, for example：", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.3244, "y": 0.8169, "w": 0.4928, "h": 0.0161}, {"t": "get your beauty sleep 说话人想要显得风趣而不是十分严肃，", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.3244, "y": 0.8328, "w": 0.5092, "h": 0.016}, {"t": "如 get your beauty sleep（睡美容觉）", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.3265, "y": 0.8503, "w": 0.308, "h": 0.0161}, {"t": "ironic 反语", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.117, "y": 0.8677, "w": 0.1047, "h": 0.0146}, {"c": 1.0, "fill": true, "x": 0.5, "y": 0.8678, "w": 0.3099, "h": 0.0147, "t": "eans the opposite: What bright spark"}, {"t": "the speaker really means the opposite: What bright spark", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.3244, "y": 0.8691, "w": 0.4825, "h": 0.0148}, {"c": 1.0, "fill": true, "x": 0.5, "y": 0.884, "w": 0.3967, "h": 0.0162, "t": "t the front door open all night? titt"}, {"t": "（=stupid person） left the front door open all night？说话人实际要表", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.3224, "y": 0.885, "w": 0.5729, "h": 0.0163}, {"c": 1.0, "fill": true, "x": 0.5, "y": 0.9018, "w": 0.3912, "h": 0.0155, "t": "!*#X, tI What bright spark (= stupid person)"}, {"t": "达的意思与字面意思相反，如 What bright spark（=stupid person）", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.3265, "y": 0.9025, "w": 0.5606, "h": 0.0161}, {"c": 0.3, "fill": true, "x": 0.5, "y": 0.918, "w": 0.3901, "h": 0.017, "t": "all night?"}, {"t": "left the front door open all night？（哪个傻瓜让前门整晚都开着？）", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.3244, "y": 0.92, "w": 0.5626, "h": 0.0161}, {"t": "• Other labels show you the context in which the idiom is usually used 还有一些标识表明习", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.0883, "y": 0.9359, "w": 0.7967, "h": 0.0163}, {"t": "语使用的上下文：", "c": 1.0, "x": 0.1211, "y": 0.9534, "w": 0.152, "h": 0.0161}, {"t": "sport 体育", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.5973, "y": 0.9774, "w": 0.099, "h": 0.0175}, {"t": "politics 政治", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.4414, "y": 0.9779, "w": 0.1172, "h": 0.0165}, {"t": "business 商业", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.1478, "y": 0.9782, "w": 0.1294, "h": 0.0145}, {"t": "law 法律", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.3142, "y": 0.9782, "w": 0.0862, "h": 0.0145}, {"t": "technical 术语", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.7351, "y": 0.9782, "w": 0.1355, "h": 0.0145}]}